[2026-01-30T14:24:29.369Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Implementation: Decompose 250+ line executeResearch methods into phase-based pipeline architecture\n\n## Context Area\nCore Research Engine\n\n## Description\nDecompose 250+ line executeResearch methods into phase-based pipeline architecture\n\n## Implementation Details\n\n## Vision\n\nRefactor the monolithic executeResearch methods (250-450 lines each) into a clean phase-based pipeline architecture with single-responsibility phase handlers, improving testability, maintainability, and enabling parallel execution of independent phases.\n\n## Business Value\n\n- Enables unit testing of individual research phases in isolation\n- Makes debugging easier by isolating failures to specific phases\n- Allows future parallel execution of independent phases (query generation, multiple searches)\n- Reduces cognitive load for developers understanding the code\n- Enables phase-level caching and retry logic\n\n## Scope\n\n**Included:**\n- Extract 6 research phases into separate handler classes/functions\n- Create ResearchPipeline orchestrator\n- Implement phase result types for clean data flow\n- Add phase-level error handling and recovery\n\n**Out of scope:**\n- Changing the Gemini client\n- Modifying database schema\n- Changing public API contracts\n\n## Key Components\n\n1. `QueryGenerationPhase` - Generates search queries from user query + template\n2. `WebSearchPhase` - Executes grounded web searches, collects sources\n3. `CredibilityAssessmentPhase` - Scores and labels source credibility\n4. `FindingExtractionPhase` - Extracts structured findings from content\n5. `PerspectiveAnalysisPhase` - Runs multi-perspective expert analysis\n6. `ReportGenerationPhase` - Generates formatted reports (optional)\n7. `ResearchPipeline` - Orchestrates phase execution with progress callbacks\n\n## Technical Approach\n\n1. Define PhaseResult interface with status, data, errors, metrics\n2. Create abstract Phase base class with execute(), validate_input(), handle_error()\n3. Extract each phase from executeResearch into separate class\n4. Create ResearchPipeline that chains phases with dependency injection\n5. Add phase-level progress callbacks for real-time updates\n6. Implement phase caching decorator for expensive operations\n7. Update executeResearch to instantiate pipeline and run\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n- `serverless/src/services/research.py` - Refactor into pipeline\n- New: `serverless/src/services/phases/` directory with phase handlers\n- New: `serverless/src/services/pipeline.py` - Pipeline orchestrator\n- `actor/src/services/research.py` - Similar refactor or delegate to serverless\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- [ ] executeResearch method under 50 lines (just pipeline setup)\n- [ ] Each phase class under 100 lines\n- [ ] All phases independently testable\n- [ ] Existing integration tests pass\n- [ ] Phase-level progress events emitted\n- [ ] Error in one search does not crash entire research\n\n## Potential Challenges\n\n- State sharing between phases (mitigate with explicit ResearchContext object)\n- Progress calculation with variable phase counts (mitigate with weighted phase system)\n- Maintaining backward compatibility (mitigate with same public API surface)\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Read and understand the implementation details above\n2. Identify all files that need to be modified\n3. Implement the changes following the guidance provided\n4. Ensure code quality and type safety\n5. Test the changes work as expected\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an accepted Development Direction.\nFocus on implementing exactly what is described above.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"a7f32e3c-0399-4a67-8280-43aee093f5ca","isSynthetic":true}
