s |\n| All phases independently testable | ✅ Each phase has `validate_input()` and typed `PhaseResult` |\n| Phase-level progress events emitted | ✅ Progress emitter called in each phase |\n| Error in one search does not crash entire research | ✅ `WebSearchPhase` returns partial success |\n\n### Architecture Benefits\n\n- **Testability**: Each phase can be unit tested in isolation\n- **Debuggability**: Failures are isolated to specific phases\n- **Maintainability**: Single-responsibility phases under 200 lines each\n- **Extensibility**: New phases can be added without modifying existing code\n- **Metrics**: Phase-level timing and token tracking via `PipelineMetrics`"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":539,"cache_read_input_tokens":110587,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":539},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"d48a0f68-b141-4160-9313-869d47f38871"}
